REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : METHOD--FLEXIBLE FITTING DETAILS--PROTOCOL-      
REMARK   3  FLEXIBLE FITTING. THE FLEXIBLE DOCKING PROCEDURE IS BASED ON A      
REMARK   3  CONNECTED (MOTION CAPTURE) NETWORK OF IDENTIFIED FEATURES WITHIN    
REMARK   3  THE ATOMIC MODEL. THE ATOMIC MODEL IS ALLOWED TO MOVE ACCORDING     
REMARK   3  TO DISPLACEMENTS TRACKED BY 31 CONTROL POINTS DEFINED BY THE        
REMARK   3  NETWORK, IN ORDER TO FIND THE BEST MATCH TO THE CRYO-EM MAP         
REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 EM IMAGE RECONSTRUCTION STATISTICS                                   
REMARK   3   NOMINAL PIXEL SIZE (ANGSTROMS)    : 2.480                          
REMARK   3   ACTUAL PIXEL SIZE  (ANGSTROMS)    : NULL                           
REMARK   3   EFFECTIVE RESOLUTION (ANGSTROMS)  : 20.00                          
REMARK   3   NUMBER OF PARTICLES               : NULL                           
REMARK   3   CTF CORRECTION METHOD             : NULL                           
REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 EM RECONSTRUCTION MAGNIFICATION CALIBRATION: NULL                    
REMARK   3                                                                      
REMARK   3 OTHER DETAILS: THREE-DIMENSIONAL SINGLE PARTICLE RECONSTRUCTION      
REMARK   3  WAS CARRIED OUT BY A MODIFICATION OF THE IHRSR METHOD, USING        
REMARK   3  SPIDER. LOW-DOSE ELECTRON MICROGRAPHS OF 1008 FROZEN-HYDRATED       
REMARK   3  THICK FILAMENTS HALVES ERE DIGITIZED AT 0.248 NM PER PIXEL USING    
REMARK   3  A NIKON SUPER COOLSCAN 8000 ED SCANNER. FILAMENTS WERE ALIGNED      
REMARK   3  WITH THE BARE ZONE AT THE TOP, TO ENSURE CORRECT POLARITY IN        
REMARK   3  SUBSEQUENT STEPS. A TOTAL OF 15,504 SEGMENTS, EACH 62 NM LONG,      
REMARK   3  WITH AN OVERLAP OF 55.8 NM, AND CONTAINING APROX. 40,000 UNIQUE     
REMARK   3  PAIRS OF INTERACTING MYOSIN HEADS WENT INTO THE RECONSTRUCTION.     
REMARK   3  AS AN INITIAL REFERENCE MODEL WE USED THE TARANTULA NEGATIVELY      
REMARK   3  STAINED 3D-MAP, WHICH WAS AXIALLY ROTATED, AXIALLY SHIFTED AND      
REMARK   3  ALSO OUT OF PLANE TILTED UP TO PLUS-MINUS12DEG. FOR PROJECTION      
REMARK   3  MATCHING, GIVING A TOTAL OF 4,095 PROJECTIONS (13 TILTED            
REMARK   3  PROJECTIONS PLUS-MINUS12DEG. EVERY 2DEG., 45 REFERENCE ROTATED      
REMARK   3  PROJECTIONS (0-90 DEGREES, 2DEG. ROTATION ANGLE), AND 7 IMAGE       
REMARK   3  AXIAL SHIFTS OF 2.2 NM. THE RESULTING 3D-MAP COMBINES ABOUT 10,     
REMARK   3  700 OUT OF 15,504 FILAMENT SEGMENTS, A YIELD OF 69 PERCENT OF       
REMARK   3  INCLUDED SEGMENTS. THERE ARE 4 HELICES OF MYOSIN HEADS, ROTATED     
REMARK   3  30 DEGREES, EVERY 145 ANGSTROMS. THE FILAMENT SEGMENTS WERE         
REMARK   3  SELECTED BASED ON VISUAL JUDGEMENT OF GOOD HELICAL ORDER.           
REMARK   4                                                                      
